### 1. Dang nhap - LUU Y dong "# @name login" phia tren
# @name login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@portfolio.local",
  "password": "Admin@12345"
}

### 2. Danh sach admin - KHONG token (phai 401)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/projects

### 3. Danh sach admin - CO token (phai 200, thay ca DRAFT)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 4. Tao project moi (phai 201)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/projects
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

{
  "title": "Du an thu nghiem",
  "slug": "du-an-thu-nghiem",
  "summary": "Tao tu API admin",
  "content": "Noi dung chi tiet",
  "status": "PUBLISHED"
}

### 5. Tao trung slug (phai 409)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/projects
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

{
  "title": "Trung slug",
  "slug": "du-an-thu-nghiem",
  "status": "DRAFT"
}

### 6. Slug sai dinh dang (phai 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/projects
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

{
  "title": "Slug xau",
  "slug": "Slug Co Khoang Trang",
  "status": "DRAFT"
}

### 7. Token bi sua (phai 401)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/projects
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJoYWNrZXIifQ.chu-ky-gia

### 8. Xoa mem project id 4 (phai 204)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/admin/projects/4
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 9. API cong khai van chay binh thuong
GET http://localhost:8080/api/projects